The narrow Layer II implementation, scale/window tables, and synthesis derive
from mpg123 1.33.7, copyright 1994-2021 the mpg123 project. Original Layer II
and window code: Michael Hipp. NEON64 float DCT and synthesis: Taihei Monma,
